    <!-- SECTION 6: Knox-Style ISP & Fingerprint Shield Section -->
    <section id="secSecurity" class="sec-container">
      <div class="knox-shield-sec">
        <div class="knox-top-row">
          <div>
            <span class="sec-eyebrow">HARDWARE-GRADE ACCOUNT ISOLATION</span>
            <h2 class="sec-h2" style="font-size:2.3rem;">Uncompromising Account Protection.<br>Shielded by Dedicated Static ISPs.</h2>
            <p class="sec-lead">
              Chain-suspensions happen when multiple accounts share datacenter IPs or mismatched browser fingerprints. X-Swarm isolates every stream on dedicated residential ISP proxies and recycles unused trial leases automatically to keep your costs minimal.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="knox-img-box">
            <img src="/uploads/lp/knox_isp_shield.png" alt="Dedicated Static ISP Shield" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="knox-3col">
          <div class="knox-sub-card">
            <h4>Persistent Fingerprint Inheritance</h4>
            <p>Automatically loads each account's original UserAgent, viewport, and WebGL renderer signature from the database to prevent suspicious login flags.</p>
          </div>
