              <li><span class="chk-svg">✓</span> <strong>5 Satellite Boosters</strong> (Likes/RTs)</li>
              <li><span class="chk-svg">✓</span> Official X API v2 (Zero Suspension)</li>
              <li><span class="chk-svg">✓</span> 🧠 <strong>AI Deliberation Council</strong></li>
